    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tiered_storage_manager" kindref="compound">TieredStorageManager</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Migration policy is evaluated by the background TierMigrationWorker at intervals of <computeroutput>migration_check_interval</computeroutput>. Both age-based and access-frequency-based rules are checked; a key is demoted when <emphasis>either</emphasis> condition is satisfied. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
